    {
      "start": 0.119,
      "end": 0.299,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.68,
      "end": 1.24,
      "text": "welcome back."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.679,
      "end": 4.239,
      "text": "I hope you have gone through the theory part for this topic."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.9,
      "end": 6.539,
      "text": "Now it's time to solve some problems."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.079,
      "end": 7.859,
      "text": "Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.5,
      "end": 10.079,
      "text": "Alex is the father of Neha,"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.719,
      "end": 11.259,
      "text": "and Neha"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.84,
      "end": 12.92,
      "text": "is the sister of John."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.759,
      "end": 17.079,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find how Alex is related to John."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.899,
      "end": 19.459,
      "text": "Here we are sure about one fact,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.979,
      "end": 23.219,
      "text": "Neha and John are brother and sister or siblings."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.76,
      "end": 25.239,
      "text": "So if Alex is Neha's father,"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.739,
      "end": 27.859,
      "text": "then Alex will also be John's father."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.34,
      "end": 30.119,
      "text": "There is no need to make it complicated here."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.679,
      "end": 32.239,
      "text": "Same father, same family relation."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.939,
      "end": 33.399,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.939,
      "end": 35.36,
      "text": "Alex is related to John as"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 36.419,
      "text": "father."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.159,
      "end": 38.779,
      "text": "So the final answer will be option A,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.279,
      "end": 39.699,
      "text": "father."
    }
  ],
